Yup, three years younger.

43
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:15,270
I totally figured his
little sister would be all...

44
00:01:15,270 --> 00:01:18,400
Tee-hee! Welcome home, big bwuther!

45
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:21,520
They look pretty similar,
but she wasn't all that friendly with him.

46
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:24,850
Wow. Can't believe Iura's a big brother.

47
00:01:24,850 --> 00:01:27,230
He's a big bwuther...

48
00:01:27,230 --> 00:01:29,940
He's pretty chill outside of school.

49
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:32,270
Whoa, really?

50
00:01:33,230 --> 00:01:34,440
'Sup, my dudes!

51
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:38,400
Let's go get ourselves burgerfied
after school, whaddya think?!

52
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:43,520
You'd better start
acting more responsible!

53
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:45,600
What?!

54
00:01:59,590 --> 00:02:11,770
Horimiya

55
00:03:18,010 --> 00:03:22,510
Student

