00:03:18,350 --> 00:03:20,560
Psych! Just kidding!

60
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:24,980
God, Shu, you're such a clown.

61
00:03:24,980 --> 00:03:28,310
Iura- <i>kun</i> is quite the comedian, isn't he?

62
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:31,730
Hey, Yanagi- <i>kun</i> ,
why do you always talk so formally?

63
00:03:31,730 --> 00:03:33,150
Wait, I do?

64
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:36,270
Yeah, you've been super polite
to us ever since the day we met.

65
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:38,150
Sorry, I suppose it's just habit.

66
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:41,730
But you're real casual with Yuki.

67
00:03:41,730 --> 00:03:42,810
Really?

68
00:03:42,810 --> 00:03:45,190
Yeah, just the other day...

69
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:46,690
Bye-bye!

70
00:03:46,690 --> 00:03:48,730
Oh, goodbye.

71
00:03:48,730 --> 00:03:50,940
Yanagin, "bye-bye"!

72
00:03:51,940 --> 00:03:52,900
Right...

73
00:03:52,900 --> 00:03:56,600
Yanagin! Bye-bye!

74
00:03:59,020 --> 00:04:01,020
B... Bye-bye.

75
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:03,980
Ohmigod, you said it! You're so cute!

76
00:04:03,980 --> 00:04:07,270
Remi-Remi, I don't know if I should
be impressed or weirded out.

77
00:04:07,270 --> 00:04:09,900
Thanks for waiting, Hori.

78
00:04:09,900 --> 00:04:11,190
What's going on there?

79
00:04:11,190 --> 00:04:14,230
Ayasaki- <i>san</i> 's messing with Yanagi- <i>kun</i> .

80
00:04:14,230 --> 00:04:15,520
Whoa.

81
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:18,690
Oh, are you guys heading home? Bye-bye!

82
00:04:18,690 --> 00:04:20,850
Bye. See you, Yanagi- <i>kun</i> .

83
00:04:20,850 --> 00:04:22,770
Goodbye.

84
00:04:22,770 --> 00:04:24,190
Later.

85
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:27,150
Yeah. Later.

86
00:04:29,230 --> 00:04:30,770
See?

87
00:04:31,770 --> 00:04:33,600
I'm not sure why that is...

88
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:35,730
I'd sure like to know why.

89
00:04:35,730 --> 00:04:39,150
Okay, Yanagi, why don't you start
calling everyone by their first name?

90
00:04:39,150 --> 00:04:40,100
